    "Skills": "Raid Boss Lv. 1 Raid Boss reward chance is reduced based on the level difference. Boss is higher: +5 - 85%, +6 - 70%, +7 - 50%, +8 - 35%. Player is higher: +6 - 85%, +7 - 70%, +8 - 50%. If player is 9 or more levels higher, Raid Curse is applied. Raid Boss Lv. 1 Fire Spirit summoned by Ketra Orcs' Guide of Dead Souls Asefa. Possessed with a strong propensity to wildness and violence, he tends to burn or destroy anything near him. He gave Ketra's Chief Brakki the power of the beasts, and is the power source of spells used by Asefa. Spirits Lv. 7 Takes 15% increased damage from attacks that are effective against Spirits. P. Def. +5% Evasion +5 Resistance to Derangement +20% Resistance to Sleep +20% M. Def. -5% Accuracy -5 HP Increase (1x) Lv. 1 MP Increase (1x) Lv. 1 Average P. Atk. Lv. 11 Average M. Atk. Lv. 11 Average P. Def. Lv. 11 Average M. Def. Lv. 11 Standard Type Lv. 2 Normal P. Def. and Evasion. Bare Hands Lv. 1 Resist Full Magic Attack Lv. 1",
